@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title AI - View AI Chat History

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The customer is signed in.

Postcondition:
None.
end note
:Open the AI chat history;
|System|
:Display the customer's sessions, newest first;
|Customer|
:Choose a session;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the session is the customer's and return its messages, oldest first;
if (The session is unknown or foreign?) then (Yes)
  :Return the not-found error;
  |Customer|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
|Customer|
:View the messages;
stop

@enduml
